LY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">□ 8</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">27</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일 전체학년 수강신청기간에는 타학년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">타학과</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">에 개설된 강좌에 여석이 있을 경우 전산으로만 수강신청 가능(수강지도 미승인자는 수강신청 불가)</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; m