TER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">□ </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">타학년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">타학과에 개설된 과목 수강신청은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교과목코드 직접입력</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">하여 수강신청</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 한국어1, 한국어2 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강좌는 외국인 학생만 수강신청 가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공에 개설된 과목 중 강의시간</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강의실 내역이 없는 강좌는 원격강좌임</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">□ </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기 개시후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">(</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설강좌 조회 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 